The '''Show-Time Cosmetic Pack''' is an active [[Gamepass]] featuring 5 exclusive skins regarding the '''Circus Troupe''' [[Toons]], {{CI|Razzle & Dazzle|name=true}}, and {{CI|Vee|name=true}} in [[Dandy's World]]. It was introduced in the [[Changelog|v0.10.1]] update as the second gamepass available in [[Dandy's Store]].

==Description==
This gamepass features 5 exclusive skins for: Blot, Looey, Razzle & Dazzle, Vee and Yatta! These skins feature unique particles, trails and Blot's ability effect. All features are cosmetic and do not affect gameplay.

==Effect==
Players who purchased this gamepass receive the 5 matching Skins for {{CI|Looey|name=true}}, {{CI|Yatta|name=true}}, {{CI|Blot|name=true}}, {{CI|Razzle & Dazzle|name=true}}, and {{CI|Vee|name=true}}.

